# Seat Reservation — project rules

## Stack

- pnpm + Turborepo: `pnpm build`, `pnpm test`, `pnpm dev:reservation`
- NestJS 11 microservices, PostgreSQL (schema per service), Kafka RPC
- Gateway `apps/gateway` — HTTP edge only; backends via Kafka `{ cmd }`, not HTTP proxy
- React + Vite `apps/web`
- Infra: `seat-reservation-infra/` (Terraform AWS)

Read `docs/architecture.md` before cross-service changes.

## Non-negotiable patterns

1. New RPC: same `{ cmd }` in gateway + `@MessagePattern`; register in `packages/be-core/messaging/kafka-rpc.commands.ts`
2. Seat holds: `pessimistic_write`, 10-minute TTL, one hold per user
3. Payments: inbox idempotency + outbox + Stripe webhook HMAC
4. Shared logic: `packages/be-core` / `packages/fe-core`

## Verify

```bash
pnpm build && pnpm test
```

